  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the curry paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and bring to a simmer.",
    "Add the haddock fillets and cook for 4 minutes, or until cooked through.",
    "Stir in the fish sauce and brown sugar.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Garnish with Thai basil leaves and serve with lime wedges on a wooden board.",
    "Serve immediately and store leftovers in an airtight container.",
    "Reheat gently before serving."
